cff-version: 1.2.0
title: llm-picker
abstract: >-
  Which local LLMs fit a given machine, which suit a given workload, and what
  breaks at each quantization band. Memory and speed are computed from published
  hardware specifications and from architecture figures measured out of each
  model's own weights; per-band defects are recorded with cited evidence.
message: If you use this data, please cite it and link back to the repository.
type: dataset
authors:
  - alias: ashe-wb
    website: https://llm-picker.dev
repository-code: https://github.com/ashe-wb/llm-picker
url: https://llm-picker.dev
license: CC-BY-4.0
license-url: https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/
keywords:
  - local-llm
  - quantization
  - kv-cache
  - inference
  - hardware
